{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國聯邦航空管理局（FAA）11月13日因多個航路交通管制中心出現通信問題，下令全美機場所有出港航班暫時停飛。停飛令持續約5小時，後於美國東部時間當晚8時15分解除；航班隨後逐步恢復，但官員提醒旅客，飛機、機組和航班安排需要時間重新銜接。正在空中的航班獲準安全降落。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586354.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:12.979375+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:42:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_hash":"49efa5bb2410e05fb4158b78a897e4f51ceef52df1c24a20c18a99e12dae247c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}